This allows type casting to various fetchargs without parentheses
by recursively calling parse_probe_arg on the target when type
casting is used.

For example, this allows the following expressions:
 - (STRUCT)%REG->FIELD
 - (STRUCT)$stackN->FIELD
 - (STRUCT)@SYM->FIELD

